      "url": "https://arxiv.org/html/2407.11005v2",
      "snippet": "We find that a 400M-parameter DeBERTa-large model that was fine-tuned on RAGBench outperforms few-shot LLM judges across numerous domains and task types. We highlight this result to motivate future work aimed at leveraging these data for advancing RAG evaluation models and improving on the proposed benchmark."
